      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TWO WHEEL JOHNNY (1) produced a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 525m behind Little Monkey (30.54) in a Mix 6/7. Placed at his previous run. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Looks the one to beat on his best form. ELORA DASH (3) finds it hard to break through. Finished in the minors last time when second (30.41) at this track making it back to back placings. Bold showing expected. WAVE IN SEA (6) showed a solid effort to win by 2 lengths at Healesville over 350m (19.91) in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. MISS IRENE (4) deserves plenty of thought at her first run at this distance.",
